⅓** of the whole pizza.", "How much is left now? Try it before you read on."]}, {"k": "recall", "t": "Adding fractions", "p": ["Make the denominators the same, then add the numerators."], "qq": {"id": "m5u09s2t01", "type": "num", "prompt": "1/3 = ?/6", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 2, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "2/6."}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Same denominator", "p": ["Subtract the numerators and keep the denominator: 7/9 − 2/9 = 5/9."]}, {"k": "idea", "t": "One denominator is a multiple of the other", "p": ["Make the denominators the same first: ⅚ − ⅓ → ⅓ = 2/6 → ⅚ − 2/6 = 3/6 = **½ of the pizza**."], "table": {"head": ["Subtraction", "Change", "Subtract", "Answer"], "rows": [["⅚ − ⅓", "⅓ = 2/6", "5/6 − 2/6", "3/6 = 1/2"], ["¾ − ⅜", "¾ = 6/8", "6/8 − 3/8", "3/8"], ["1 − ⅖", "1 = 5/5", "5/5 − 2/5", "3/5"]]}}, {"k": "try", "t": "Same denominator", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m5u09s2t02", "type": "num", "prompt": "6/7 − 2/7? Give your answer as a fraction in its simplest form.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 0.5714285714285714, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 1e-06, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "4/7."}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I subtract fractions?", "p": ["Step 1: Make the denominators the same.", "Step 2: Subtract the numerators; keep the denominator.", "Step 3: From 1: write 1 as n/n.", "Step 4: Simplify the answer."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Same denominator", "p": [], "q": "9/10 − 4/10.", "steps": [["5/10", ""], ["= 1/2", ""]], "a": "1/2"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Multiple", "p": [], "q": "7/8 − 1/4.", "steps": [["1/4 = 2/8", ""], ["7/8 − 2/8", ""]], "a": "5/8"}, {"k": "example", "t": "From one", "p": [], "q": "1 − 3/8.", "steps": [["8/8 − 3/8", ""]], "a": "5/8"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Real life", "p": [], "q": "A tank is 4/5 full; 3/10 is used.", "steps": [["8/10 − 3/10 = 5/10", ""]], "a": "1/2 full"}, {"k": "try", "t": "Mu